7,Wololo Congolese Song | TikTok,https://www.tiktok.com/discover/wololo-congolese-song,"Discover the vibrant rhythm of the 'Wololo' Congolese song, a blend of gospel and culture that captivates audiences worldwide. wololo Congolese song, Congolese gospel music, Wololo Nigerian song, Faveur Mukoko music, Kinshasa Wololo song Last updated 2025-06-16.",Gokana,Niger-Congo
8,"Unfurnished Houses, Flats & Land for Sale in... | Nigeria Property Centre",https://nigeriapropertycentre.com/for-sale/unfurnished/rivers/gokana,"Created in 1991, Gokana is one of the Local Government Areas in Rivers state, Nigeria. Its headquarters is in Kpor. Gokana is divided into sixteen towns, each headed by a king. The sixteen towns are further subdivided into villages. All sixteen towns have one common ancestry.",Gokana,Niger-Congo
